        "name": "USN-8944-1",
        "description": "This update removes the \"emSign ECC Root CA - G3\" CA certificate due to intermediate CA certificates being compromised.  In addition, in Ubuntu 22.04 LTS, Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, and Ubuntu 26.04 LTS, the ca-certificates package contained outdated CA certificates. This update refreshes the included certificates to those contained in the 2.90 version of the Mozilla certificate authority bundle.",
